<activity>
 <!--Question 11-->
<statement>
<p>Carry out a randomization test (shuffling) for this table using the chi-square statistic. 
Overlay the chi-square distribution on the simulated null distribution of chi-square statistic 
values. Does it appear to be a reasonable model for the null distribution?</p>
</statement>
</activity>

<activity>
 <!--Question 12-->
